  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025-26 NZDRP Bangladesh Multiyear Rohingya Refugee Crisis &amp; Flood Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025-26 Multiyear New Zealand humanitarian support for Rohingya refugees in Bangladesh, including humanitarian responses to recent flooding in Bangladesh more widely. A bulk of the funding will be allocated to ongoing Rohingya refugee crisis relief work.&#xa0; Programming will be delivered in partnership with Aotearoa NZ NGOs&#xa0;working through their&#xa0;partner organisations in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
